# VERBATIM data block data_mo_xue_af_cobr4_net4_0m_b from CCDC deposition 2525232 (CCDC Access Structures, downloaded by the user), cited in 10.1021/acs.inorgchem.6c00405 CCDC 2525232
# (NEt4)2[CoBr4] (Co-Br) at 295 K, determined in this work (the only Co-Br structure deposited by the paper; a literature RT structure, ref 80, is used for the Table 1 comparison). The paper does not explicitly say which Co-Br structure the AILFT used; geometry_source says this work's. Cation disorder noted by the authors.; crystal formula C16 H40 Br4 Co N2. Experimental (X-ray) structure, not optimised. Embedded reflection data omitted.
